      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Krea 2 Turbo \u2014 text to image\n\n**Matched set (change one, change all five):**\n\n| slot | value |\n|---|---|\n| diffusion model | `krea2TurboFP8_krea2TURBO.safetensors` |\n| text encoder | `qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors` \u2014 `CLIPLoader type = **krea2**` |\n| VAE | `qwen_image_vae.safetensors` |\n| latent | from `VAEEncode` (16-ch) |\n| patch node | **none** \u2014 Krea 2 has no `ModelSampling*` and no `FluxGuidance` |\n\n`type=krea2` is not guessable: an unknown string silently falls back to CLIP-L\nand fails much later with a shape error.\n\n**Turbo is guidance-distilled \u21d2 CFG stays at 1.0.** The negative branch is never\nevaluated at CFG 1.0, which is why the negative prompt runs through\n`ConditioningZeroOut` instead of carrying text. Raising CFG degrades output.\n\n### Use this first\nIf an image-to-image result looks wrong, run **this** file first. It isolates\nthe question \"is the model + encoder + VAE trio healthy?\" from everything the\ni2i graph adds on top.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
